  // =========================================================================
  // 2A-EAST. 3D CONSTRUCTION EQUIPMENT & MATERIAL YARDS ("AREA TANAH ALAT-ALAT KONSTRUKSI")
  //          100% North-South Symmetric Construction Yards at x in [53.0..73.5], |z| in [46.0..104.0]
  //          Featuring Tracked Excavators/Bulldozers, Stacked Steel I-Beam Girders,
